{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8b633042-75dc-513c-b51e-2589a2e36add", "source_ordinal": 2789, "reading_ordinal": 1264, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "阴谋阳谋", "published_at": "2022-05-23T20:50:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/21866797/answer/2498384543"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "阴谋，是指不对对手公布或者公布假信息的谋划。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "阳谋，是指对对手公开真实意图的谋划。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在根本的意义上，这两者都是中性的。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "按照上述定义，阴谋的范围可能远比你以为的大。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "举个例子——", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一家公司完全不做任何宣发地秘密研发可能占领对手主要市场的产品，这就已经算阴谋。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "有人看你生意不错，研究你的经营模式、产品设计，然后不声不响在你对门开了一家店。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这已经可以叫阴谋。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "阴谋又分白阴谋和黑阴谋。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "白阴谋是游戏规则之内的——开发秘密产品，策划商业计划，谋划的股市操作，本来就没有义务对任何人透露，也没有义务避免任何人的误判和误读，这是自然而然的合理行为。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果两国本来就是敌国，那么连同放假情报、做假动作诱使对手做出错误判断也一样是白阴谋——它并没有违背什么契约承诺。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而黑阴谋的问题也就在于此——它的问题不是隐藏和欺骗，而是违背了既定契约的隐藏与欺骗。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "比如，公司部门经理隐瞒本该要报告的数据；某家上市企业隐瞒本该披露的信息；某个国家故意向盟国提供假情报；某个人故意误导队友或朋友、亲人，这些隐瞒和欺骗违背了自己自愿约定的义务，这就不但是阴谋，而且是黑阴谋了。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那么为什么人们似乎没有黑阴谋和白阴谋的概念，感觉一提阴谋就全部都是有道德问题的黑阴谋？", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这是因为前现代的伦理观还没有退出历史舞台。", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "根据传统的伦理观，朋友有通家之义，手足有患难与共之理。在充满无常危险的世界上，老乡、同学、亲戚……都不是简单的互助关系，而是一种抱团求生、株连九族的同生共死的共存关系。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "在这种关系下，你对你的一切共存者都有近乎无穷的披露义务和诚实义务，理当知无不言、言无不尽。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "于是任何的隐瞒和伪造，都自然而然的构成黑阴谋。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "问题是，这个前提条件现在并不存在了，但大众意识还没有接受这个事实，这才会导致白阴谋身上的污名挥之不去，也导致“光明正大”成了一种侵犯ta人合理秘密的撬门棍。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "然后再说阳谋。", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "阳谋就是明确的告知外界具体计划的谋略。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "就像下象棋时棋手明确的告诉对方自己的下一步棋。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 829}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "阳谋并不见得一定是友好的，甚至都不见得是合法或者道德的。", "char_start": 830, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "quote", "index": 24, "text": "闻君有白玉美人，妙手雕成，极尽妍态，不胜心向往之。今夜子正，当踏月来取。君素雅达，必不致令我徒劳往返也。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 911}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这位要偷东西。", "char_start": 912, "char_end": 919}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "quote", "index": 26, "text": "近者奉辞伐罪，旄麾南指，刘琮束手。今治水军八十万众，方与将军会猎于吴。", "char_start": 920, "char_end": 955}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这位要杀人。", "char_start": 956, "char_end": 962}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "而这却都是阳谋。", "char_start": 963, "char_end": 971}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "阳谋本身也并不格外道德——这种声称本身就是策略的一部分，是一种促成结果发生的手段。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 1013}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "并且它只是由声明方以有限信用作保，未必就不是声东击西的阴谋的一部分。", "char_start": 1014, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "谋略本身是阴是阳，其实并不是与道德性互相绑定的。阴谋未必不道德，阳谋则未必就道德。", "char_start": 1050, "char_end": 1091}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "道德与否的要害是动机、是有没有违背某种双方同意的契约。", "char_start": 1092, "char_end": 1119}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "要养成习惯——", "char_start": 1121, "char_end": 1128}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "阴谋本身不是问题，背信弃义才是。", "char_start": 1129, "char_end": 1145}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36, "quote": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：阴谋与阳谋的区别?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“阴谋阳谋”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“阴谋，是指不对对手公布或者公布假信息的谋划。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "阴谋，是指不对对手公布或者公布假信息的谋划。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5fec34bb-5049-51a4-8bc8-ca7f92368431", "source_ordinal": 2788, "reading_ordinal": 1265, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "乾坤一掷", "published_at": "2022-05-24T00:11:26+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/388661726/answer/2498619637"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没啥深层的含义，小说都写得很直白了啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "芮小丹决定了要得到，于是就用了自己觉得最有效的手段。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这个手段看上去激烈，主要是取决于目标——因为她觉得这对丁元英合适。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "其实常规恋爱那些一步三摇的漫长试探心意的过程，主要是因为少男女少女们自己严重的安全感不足，所以要层层得证，步步为营。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但对那些安全感十足、天老大我老二甚至我老大天老二的人来说，这些“安全仪式”本来就是可以大幅缩减甚至干脆排除的。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实芮小丹具体冒了什么大不了的险呢？怕被骗财？被骗色？被抛弃？被欺骗？", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这些东西她根本都不怕。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "她只怕夜长梦多，求而不得，", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "怕得不着又不甘心。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "拜危机四伏的生存风险所赐，女性的社会化发育水平普遍的高于同龄男性，对这些关系运算的能力之强、经验之丰富、决心之果断，常常被大大的低估。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "连她们自己都常常意识不到。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你别看她们萌萌的、软软的，看上去笨笨的，呆呆的，真到了关头上，你才会知道这些小白兔是些什么样的狠角色。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "芮小丹这事，对于活明白了的女性而言，并不奇怪。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 426}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而女性在二十几岁，已经有很多人活得很明白了。这个比例虽然不是70～80%，可能只有5～10%。", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但是坦率讲，人类整体能活到这样明白的比例可能一共也就10%上下——全体，终身。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 514}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以这个比例其实已经是很高了。", "char_start": 515, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你觉得她是小白兔？", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你可能说得没错。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 550}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "问题是，", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你可能是胡萝卜。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 564}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：遥远的救世主，芮小丹脱下睡衣站在丁元英面前那段是什么深层含义？该怎样看待？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“乾坤一掷”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没啥深层的含义，小说都写得很直白了啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没啥深层的含义，小说都写得很直白了啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4ee31cc9-ff47-5590-a87e-3f968e2ca5b2", "source_ordinal": 2787, "reading_ordinal": 1266, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "摞你命3000", "published_at": "2022-05-24T09:19:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/21619474/answer/2498872280"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人常有一种念头——“把ABC合起来，肯定比ABC都厉害”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "Well……", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“三教合一”的问题，是它很容易帮你进入一个虚无主义的状态，帮你解决“想不开”“放不下”的问题，", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但也同样容易导致你“不能打”。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一个有效的信仰体系，必须同时解决“想不开”和“不能打”。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "大部分人的做法都是“打不过了用科学，想不开了用玄学”。但是搞着搞着就忍不住走火入魔，要用科学强行对接玄学，用玄学强行指引科学。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "接不上去，就用大量的无明确定义的含糊话当粘合剂糊上，就像在松树根上用水泥糊上了一辆自行车。", "char_start": 195, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "并且反正是玄学了，反正用了“不明物质”了，索性“抛弃门户之见”“博采众长”“融会贯通”“三教合一”—— 一颗松树，桃李不言。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "搞到自行车也不能骑，松树也看不得了。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不同的信仰体系，即使用字相同的概念，彼此之间也不是一回事。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你可以看了其它体系的概念来启发你对这一个概念的理解，但仅止于此了，并不能因此拍拍脑袋说“A就是B”并且把它当“创见”。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个方法是个巨大的陷阱，直线指向“想得开但不能打”。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "问题是，你真的愿意用“不能打”换“想得开”吗？", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“想得开”真的有“能打”重要吗？", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 481}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-05/24/e684e365153333a2987f7b952d86ce04.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：电视剧《天道》里的“神即道，道法自然，如来”，作何解释，一直没有理解透彻?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“摞你命3000”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人常有一种念头——“把ABC合起来，肯定比ABC都厉害”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人常有一种念头——“把ABC合起来，肯定比ABC都厉害”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5fb90f05-459a-520d-9c10-08b51dcf477f", "source_ordinal": 2786, "reading_ordinal": 1267, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "定规矩", "published_at": "2022-05-24T11:42:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/523191255/answer/2499129712"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "谁说都是我“定规矩”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我去公司，就是我的老板“定规矩”。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我去坐船，就是船长“定规矩”。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我去开会，就是会议主持人“定规矩”。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "大家都是从小孩开始经过各种各样的经历最后被指定到不同的位置上，当上父母、老板、船长、主持人的。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你还没走完这个过程，走完了你也许有机会给别人定规矩。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 139}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子问「为什么都是你定规矩」，我该如何回应？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“定规矩”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“谁说都是我“定规矩”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "谁说都是我“定规矩”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1f6d2379-e6ed-5e52-a24d-1bbb60aa586b", "source_ordinal": 2785, "reading_ordinal": 1268, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "预备死亡", "published_at": "2022-05-24T13:45:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/532437441/answer/2499291627"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "试试开始写遗嘱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "写好了没事就修改。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "每个季度搞个大版本公证一下。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "写写改改，", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "改改写写。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "什么时候你对遗嘱满意了，", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你也就没这个害怕了。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 69}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我今年75，心里非常害怕死亡，怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“预备死亡”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“试试开始写遗嘱。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "试试开始写遗嘱。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d67dd01f-6537-50b1-b809-60c6c3014a7c", "source_ordinal": 2784, "reading_ordinal": 1269, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "目标谷爱凌", "published_at": "2022-05-24T21:49:59+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/534143389/answer/2499976459"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫做“把谷爱凌当目标”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是指“取得两枚奥运金牌 + 考上斯坦福 + 当上模特”吗？", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是在担忧这种“业绩压力”会造成性格缺陷，然后反而得不偿失？", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "于是觉得“我只期盼你当个普通人”至少在这方面没有风险？", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "那么，“我只期望你当个普通人”，怎么解释你要花钱帮我上贵族学校呢？为什么你要帮我创造种种条件“追求成功”呢？", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你的子女上的什么学校？是“普通人上的普通学校”吗？", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "第二，如果你确实指望我当个普通人，那么普通人英语不怎么样啊，你催我学英语干嘛？", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "普通人身材都一般啊，你为什么要催我减肥？", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你说只期待我当普通人，那么我按普通人的标准自我要求，为什么不行？", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以啊，父母——尤其是中产阶级以上的父母——说什么“我只期望你当个普通人”，纯属自欺欺人。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这只是一种发现子女有抑郁 / 自毁迹象，于是鸡贼的拿来挂在嘴边给自己脱罪的说辞罢了。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "成龙成凤的事我全都做了，但是这话我全不说。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "将来你“抑郁”了可怪不着我，我可一直都表示“只期望你当个普通人”的，你别冤枉我。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "有意思吗？有用吗？", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "问题的症结并不在“应该把期望奥运夺冠改成期望成为普通人”上。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "问题的症结在“期望不应该放在成就”上。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我根本没资格去“期望”你是奥运夺冠，还是成为普通人。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我又不是上帝，我的“期望“根本没有什么意义。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "同样，你也不是上帝，你的“期望“也没什么意义。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 566}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "既不要期望奥运拿牌，也不要期望成为普通人。", "char_start": 567, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你要做的，是不要搞到命运让你当了什么，结果你当不住。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "命运要你当奥运冠军，你就要当得住，当得好。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "命运要你当普通人，你也要当得住，当得好。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我的责任是帮你获得从命运的一切安排中尽量结出最多果子、得到最好体验的技能和准备。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不是去帮你锁定我对你的人生规划——无论是奥运冠军，还是普通人。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "也不是去帮你锁定你对你自己的人生规划。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我算什么东西，你算什么东西？人的命运轮得到我们来“规划”？", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你能管住中美冲不冲突吗？还是能管住新冠发不发生？还是能管住俄罗斯打不打乌克兰、石油涨不涨价？还是说你能保证无论发生什么都不可能影响到你的计划？", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 853}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你要是管不住，你那些志在必得、于是将整个前半生寄托在达到某个里程碑上的规划有何意义？", "char_start": 854, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你以为这是“降低要求”就可以解决问题的吗？", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 918}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "那万一要是你计划当个普通人，结果命运把你送上了操作台，你要么挺身成为英雄，要么缩头受万世憎恨，就是没有“当个普通人”这个选项呢？", "char_start": 919, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "幸福不幸福的要害根本不在于奥运冠军还是普通人，把前者改成后者根本不解决任何问题——事实上还制造了问题。", "char_start": 985, "char_end": 1036}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你喊着期望ta当奥运冠军，ta没达到你的期望，ta还可以喊一嘴“我只想当个普通人”。", "char_start": 1037, "char_end": 1079}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你一直嘴上说“只期望ta当普通人”，ta没达到你的期望——以你这个口是心非的、嘴上不说的、事实上的奥运冠军的期待，这基本上是必然结果——ta再要怎么办？", "char_start": 1080, "char_end": 1156}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你一直在喊只期望ta当个普通人，然后你还是唉声叹气、眉头紧锁，", "char_start": 1157, "char_end": 1188}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你觉得ta会怎么想？会怎么办？", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1204}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这种游戏，难道你只要不押大、改押小，你就不会输？", "char_start": 1205, "char_end": 1229}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "想不输，唯一的出路是根本不要玩。", "char_start": 1230, "char_end": 1246}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "谷爱凌拿没拿奥运金牌、当没当model、上没上斯坦福，根本不是谷爱凌值得你注意的地方。", "char_start": 1248, "char_end": 1291}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "是她在最后关头仍然敢做大动作的勇气、敢于不在乎一些活见鬼的烂话的硬气、坚持练习精益求精的恒心，很值得你拿来当目标。", "char_start": 1292, "char_end": 1349}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "奥运冠军还是普通人，这要看上帝。这份勇气、硬气、恒心，你要有。", "char_start": 1350, "char_end": 1381}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "不管当奥运冠军还是当普通人，没这些都会痛苦——你以为奥运冠军就肯定不会痛苦吗？奥运冠军就肯定不会自杀？", "char_start": 1382, "char_end": 1433}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "无论是当奥运冠军还是当普通人，有这些都会容易活得开心。", "char_start": 1434, "char_end": 1461}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "从奥运冠军撞断了腿，变成了普通人，有这些一样容易活得开心。", "char_start": 1462, "char_end": 1491}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "从普通人一夜成名，变成了奥运冠军，有这些一样容易活得开心。", "char_start": 1492, "char_end": 1521}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "谷爱凌不是问题。", "char_start": 1522, "char_end": 1530}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "你才是问题。", "char_start": 1531, "char_end": 1537}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "早点改了这种“成就期望”的恶习。", "char_start": 1538, "char_end": 1554}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 54}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价万科创始人王石称「不应把谷爱凌当做目标教育子女」？你觉得中国父母在教育上存在哪些问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048"], "summary": "围绕“目标谷爱凌”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫做“把谷爱凌当目标”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫做“把谷爱凌当目标”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "06ac509e-a452-5db7-9a99-c1510e294262", "source_ordinal": 2783, "reading_ordinal": 1270, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "四级威慑", "published_at": "2022-05-26T17:16:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/533762700/answer/2502664615"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "难道你不也是找个律师陪ta打……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "把律师费放进诉求里去，赔款要求计算利息，提前申请财产保全。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "然后让律师陪ta打去呗。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这就是正常的法律实践，不要大惊小怪。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你从一开始就不要指望司法程序会很快，随便就可能拖上半年一年，正常就是这速度，这甚至谈不上什么“陪你拖”。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "维护自己的权益，法律只能担当顺位非常低的保障。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这种安全策略，可以分为以下几级——", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "lv1）做一个对方不愿意失去的人。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这主要靠手握价值源头。跟我关系好，你就源源不断有好处——或者将来可能有好处。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "搞得我对你不爽，这个好处就没了，或者没指望了。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "超级朴素，用不着解释，用不着跟对方纠缠什么正义、公平、“凭什么”，痛快又简单。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "问题是，你得先能创造价值。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个靠有创造能力。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "lv2）成为一个对方不容易实施伤害的人。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人家想陷害你，抓不到把柄；想暗杀你，找不到你的位置；想要挟你，找不到你的亲属的信息。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个靠为人谨慎。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "lv3）成为一个对方预知伤害后要付出相当代价的人。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "也就是提前让人知道你有报复的意志和能力，而且不可能因为被先发制人的打击而被剥夺——比如就算提前把你消灭了，也会有人来替你复仇。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但从这一级开始，就会出现副作用——这样固然可以吓阻想伤害你的人，但是也会导致人对你望而却步，敬而远之。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为谁知道哪里不小心得罪了你，会被你认定犯有冒犯罪，惹上大麻烦？", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "lv4）成为一个“对方并不提前预知你有报复的意志和能力，甚至自认为你没有，只是事后会发现自己误判”的人。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这种只能勉强阻止对方对你进行反复伤害，阻止不了对方的第一次侵犯的妄念。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "大部分被迫打官司的人，都是最后这一种。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "思考一下你要站在哪。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 690}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待「我知道，这个官司我会输，但我可以找个律师陪着你们打，拖个一年半年的没什么问题」的社会现象？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“四级威慑”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“难道你不也是找个律师陪ta打……”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "难道你不也是找个律师陪ta打……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2afb95a7-5ca8-5051-8189-3cd6ad67bcac", "source_ordinal": 2782, "reading_ordinal": 1271, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "美人", "published_at": "2022-05-26T18:21:24+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/301105442/answer/2502762774"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "男性长得漂亮不讨论了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "女性长得漂亮则有长得漂亮的痛苦。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "甚至是危险。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你只看到她们的“风光”，没想过这些东西带给她们的代价是什么。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "多少人在暗中窥伺，居心叵测，随时随地可能乘虚而入，做些见不得光的脏事；", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "多少人“爱“而不得，不是要杀你毁你，就是要同归于尽，再要么就要自杀把你写在血书上；", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "多少人妒嫉衔恨，中伤陷害，有意无意做伪证；", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "多少人处心积虑、不择手段，威逼利诱，要逼你就范。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "多少人只看你的皮囊，不假思索的无视你的人格和智慧。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "人因为“漂亮”而给你的“优势”，很多都是不但要还，还要收利息的。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "人缺的是爱，不是这些“欢迎”。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "美人可怜。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 273}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0202"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：长的漂亮真的很有优势吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“美人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“男性长得漂亮不讨论了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "男性长得漂亮不讨论了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
